msgid "问题理解：从自然语言到问题草稿"
msgstr "Problem Understanding: Natural Language to Problem Draft"

msgid "主链顺序固定为："
msgstr "The main chain has a fixed order:"

msgid "基本用法"
msgstr "Basic usage"

msgid "Agent A 是强制门"
msgstr "Agent A is mandatory"

msgid "本地开源 LLM 后端"
msgstr "Local open-source LLM backend"

msgid "M27 可选用本机 OpenAI 兼容接口提取更一般的 PDE 问题事实。默认连接 ``http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1``，推荐中文和公式表现较好的 Qwen2.5-Instruct 1.5B 或 3B 级模型；模型权重由 Ollama 管理，不进入 OpenPINN 仓库："
msgstr "M27 can optionally use a local OpenAI-compatible endpoint to extract more general PDE problem facts. The default is ``http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1``. Qwen2.5-Instruct models in the 1.5B or 3B class are recommended for Chinese and formulas; Ollama manages model weights, which are not stored in the OpenPINN repository:"

msgid "Python 调用不受浏览器 CORS 限制："
msgstr "Python calls are not subject to browser CORS restrictions:"

msgid "``rules`` 是默认的确定性离线路径；``llm`` 调用本地接口；``auto`` 优先尝试本地 接口，连接失败时退回规则。也可用环境变量 ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_BACKEND``、 ``OPENPINN_OLLAMA_BASE_URL``、``OPENPINN_OLLAMA_MODEL`` 和 ``OPENPINN_OLLAMA_TIMEOUT`` 设置默认值。接口不可达、超时或 JSON 不合法都会在 ``warnings`` 中加入 ``understanding.llm_fallback``，不会静默伪造成功。不合法的 LLM JSON 绝不会标记就绪。"
msgstr "``rules`` is the default deterministic offline path; ``llm`` calls the local endpoint; ``auto`` tries the local endpoint first and falls back to rules if the connection fails. Defaults can also be set with ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_BACKEND``, ``OPENPINN_OLLAMA_BASE_URL``, ``OPENPINN_OLLAMA_MODEL``, and ``OPENPINN_OLLAMA_TIMEOUT``. An unreachable endpoint, timeout, or invalid JSON adds ``understanding.llm_fallback`` to ``warnings`` instead of silently faking success. Invalid LLM JSON is never marked ready."

msgid "LLM 只返回问题侧 JSON；输出中的代码、训练脚本、网络、优化器和方法规划字段会被拒绝。 应用忽略模型对就绪状态的任何主张，并始终用现有 Agent A ``validate`` 重新判断。 因此，一维热方程或二维 Poisson 等事实可以先进入草稿和追问，但在 Agent A 的 ``ProblemSpec`` 扩展支持它们之前不会进入 CodeBuilder。"
msgstr "The LLM returns only problem-side JSON; code, training-script, network, optimizer, and method-planning fields are rejected. The application ignores any readiness claim by the model and always asks the existing Agent A ``validate`` gate. Facts for a one-dimensional heat equation or two-dimensional Poisson problem can therefore enter the draft and questions, but cannot enter CodeBuilder until Agent A's ``ProblemSpec`` supports them."

msgid "用户自有云 API Key"
msgstr "User-owned cloud API Key"

msgid "同一个 ``backend=\"llm\"`` 也支持用户自己的 OpenAI-compatible 云或国内兼容接口。 传入 ``api_key`` 后，标准库客户端只把它放在 ``Authorization: Bearer`` 请求头， 不会写入 prompt、报告或错误消息："
msgstr "The same ``backend=\"llm\"`` supports a user-owned OpenAI-compatible cloud or domestic-compatible endpoint. When ``api_key`` is supplied, the standard-library client places it only in the ``Authorization: Bearer`` header and never writes it into the prompt, report, or error messages:"

msgid "除参数外，也可直接使用 ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_BASE_URL``、 ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_MODEL``、``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_API_KEY`` 和 ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_TIMEOUT``。不要把 Key 写入 Python 文件、shell 历史、文档、 截图、测试夹具或 Git。不同兼容服务的 base URL、模型名、配额和数据政策不同，必须以 所选服务商文档为准。"
msgstr "Instead of arguments, you can use ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_BASE_URL``, ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_MODEL``, ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_API_KEY``, and ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_TIMEOUT``. Do not put the Key in Python files, shell history, documentation, screenshots, test fixtures, or Git. Compatible services differ in base URL, model names, quotas, and data policies; follow the selected provider's documentation."

msgid "网页直连与 Key 安全"
msgstr "Direct browser connection and Key security"

msgid ":doc:`Understanding 网页试用 <understanding_trial>` 只有用户 API Key 路径，不显示 规则或自动模式。URL、模型和 Key 只保存在当前浏览器的 ``localStorage``；请求由浏览器 直接发往用户填写的接口，不经过 OpenPINN 服务器。点击“清除 Key”会删除对应存储项并 清空输入。只应在自己信任的设备和浏览器配置文件中使用；共享设备使用后应立即清除。"
msgstr "The :doc:`Understanding Web Trial <understanding_trial>` exposes only the user API Key path, with no Rules or Auto mode. The URL, model, and Key are stored only in this browser's ``localStorage``; the browser sends requests directly to the entered endpoint without an OpenPINN server. Clear Key deletes the storage entry and empties the input. Use it only on a trusted device and browser profile, and clear it immediately after use on a shared device."

msgid "报告中的“填入配置器”使用当前标签页的 ``sessionStorage`` 做一次性传递，只包含问题 草稿和映射结果，不包含 API Key。所有已声明物理族都可进入自定义 PDE/BC 编辑器；未知 物理族仍会追问物理类型。``ready_for_validation`` 只表示当前物理族的问题侧信息自洽， 不等于 Agent A 或代码生成校验通过。"
msgstr "Apply to configurator uses this tab's ``sessionStorage`` for a one-time handoff containing only the problem draft and mapping result, never the API Key. Every declared physics family can enter the custom PDE/BC editor; unknown physics still asks for its type. ``ready_for_validation`` means only that the problem-side facts are consistent for the current family, not that Agent A or code-generation validation passed."

msgid "服务商必须允许文档页面 origin 的 CORS 请求，并接受 OpenAI-compatible ``/chat/completions`` 与 Bearer 认证。浏览器扩展、本机恶意软件和同源脚本仍可能读取 ``localStorage``，因此网页保存并不等同于操作系统密钥库。缺少 Key、HTTP 错误、超时、 CORS 或 JSON 校验失败都会显示明确错误、清除旧的就绪显示，且不会静默退回规则并冒充 LLM 成功。页面交付后由用户用自己的真实 Key 自行测试；自动测试只使用 mock Key 和 mock HTTP，不连接任何服务商。"
msgstr "The provider must allow CORS requests from the documentation origin and accept OpenAI-compatible ``/chat/completions`` with Bearer authentication. Browser extensions, local malware, and same-origin scripts may still read ``localStorage``, so browser storage is not an operating-system key vault. A missing Key, HTTP error, timeout, CORS failure, or JSON validation failure produces a clear error, clears stale readiness, and never silently falls back to rules while pretending LLM success. After delivery, the user tests with their own real Key; automated tests use only a mock Key and mock HTTP and never contact a provider."

msgid "提示词还要求 ``pde.expression`` 使用配置器可解析的 ASCII 语法：导数写作 ``dx``、 ``dy``、``dt``，乘法使用显式 ``*``，不输出 ``Δ``、``∇``、下标导数或隐式乘法。 浏览器映射器会为缺少公式的结构化热传导或泊松草稿合成同一语法的残差。"
msgstr "The prompt also requires ``pde.expression`` to use configurator-compatible ASCII syntax: derivatives use ``dx``, ``dy``, and ``dt``; multiplication uses explicit ``*``; and output must not contain ``Δ``, ``∇``, subscript derivatives, or implicit multiplication. The browser mapper synthesizes residuals in the same syntax for structured heat or Poisson drafts that omit a formula."

msgid "Problem Understanding 本身不选择网络、采样器、损失或优化器。M32 在现有 Validation 之后加入独立的 Planning 薄切片；它只推荐方法草稿，不生成训练脚本，也不调用 ``solve`` 或 ``train_operator``。Repair 仍是路线图能力。"
msgstr "Problem Understanding itself does not select a network, sampler, loss, or optimizer. M32 adds a separate Planning thin slice after Validation. It recommends only a method draft, generates no training script, and calls neither ``solve`` nor ``train_operator``. Repair remains on the roadmap."

msgid "Solver Planning"
msgstr "Solver Planning"

msgid "``openpinn.agents.plan_method`` 接收完整 ``ProblemSpec``、Understanding 可消费的结构化 草稿或配置器问题侧字典，返回固定字段的 ``PlanReport``：``method_draft``、 ``rationale``、``warnings`` 与 ``ready_for_validation``。主路径是 OpenAI-compatible LLM；确定性规则表只用于无 Key、接口失败、坏 JSON 和 CI fallback。"
msgstr "``openpinn.agents.plan_method`` accepts a complete ``ProblemSpec``, a structured Understanding-compatible draft, or a configurator problem mapping. It returns a fixed ``PlanReport`` with ``method_draft``, ``rationale``, ``warnings``, and ``ready_for_validation``. An OpenAI-compatible LLM is primary; deterministic rules are only for missing-Key, endpoint, invalid-JSON, and CI fallback."

msgid "``ready_for_validation=True`` 只表示方法草稿能通过 ``MethodSpec`` 与注册表检查，不表示 问题规格或问题—方法组合已经通过 Agent A。声称可生码、复制或下载前，调用方必须另外要求 ``validate(problem, method_draft).ok``。Planning 不生码、不训练，也不调用 Repair。"
msgstr "``ready_for_validation=True`` means only that the method draft passes ``MethodSpec`` and registry checks. It does not mean Agent A accepted the problem-method pair. Before claiming code generation, copy, or download readiness, the caller must also require ``validate(problem, method_draft).ok``. Planning does not generate code, train, or call Repair."

msgid "``backend`` 支持 ``llm``、``rules`` 与默认的 ``auto``。``auto`` 在有 Key 时先请求 LLM； 端点不可达或输出形状不合法会使用 rules fallback，并加入 ``planning.rules_fallback`` 警告。显式 ``llm`` 失败会返回 ``ready_for_validation=False``，不会伪装成功。未知物理族 只给保守草稿并标记未就绪；LLM 或 hints 给出的未注册方法、模型、采样器、损失、优化器和 微分器会被 ``MethodSpec`` 拒绝。"
msgstr "``backend`` supports ``llm``, ``rules``, and the default ``auto``. With a Key, ``auto`` tries the LLM first; an unreachable endpoint or invalid output uses rules with a ``planning.rules_fallback`` warning. Explicit ``llm`` failure returns ``ready_for_validation=False``. Unknown physics gets a conservative not-ready draft, and ``MethodSpec`` rejects unregistered components from the LLM or hints."

msgid "Planning 环境变量优先使用 ``OPENPINN_PLAN_BASE_URL``、``OPENPINN_PLAN_MODEL``、 ``OPENPINN_PLAN_API_KEY``、``OPENPINN_PLAN_TIMEOUT``；未设置时依次复用对应的 ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_*`` 和本地 Ollama 设置。Key 只进入 Bearer 请求头，不得写入仓库、 测试、文档或截图。完整二维线弹性可与当前 ``ProblemSpec`` 一起做 Agent A 端到端校验； 热传导与 Poisson 规划草稿能通过 ``MethodSpec``，但在它们进入完整 ``ProblemSpec`` 前， 不能声称已通过问题—方法端到端门禁。"
msgstr "Planning prefers ``OPENPINN_PLAN_BASE_URL``, ``OPENPINN_PLAN_MODEL``, ``OPENPINN_PLAN_API_KEY``, and ``OPENPINN_PLAN_TIMEOUT``; otherwise it reuses ``OPENPINN_UNDERSTAND_*`` and then local Ollama settings. The Key appears only in the Bearer header. Complete 2D elasticity can run the current end-to-end Agent A gate; heat and Poisson plans pass ``MethodSpec`` but cannot claim that end-to-end gate before complete ``ProblemSpec`` support."

msgid "网页中的“推荐方法”复用 Understanding 页的用户 URL、模型与 Key，只显示方法草稿、理由 和警告。浏览器形状预检不能代替 Python Agent A，也不会直接把结果写入代码生成器。"
msgstr "Recommend method reuses the user's Understanding URL, model, and Key and displays only the method draft, rationale, and warnings. The browser shape check cannot replace Python Agent A and does not write directly into the code generator."

msgid "当前规则后端仍只抽取它原来就会抽取的二维线弹性子集。热传导和泊松草稿主要由 LLM 提取；规则路径在物理族没有被写进草稿时只会询问物理族。Understanding 的 Operator 路径仍只整理问题侧字段；方法选择由后续 ``plan_method`` 完成。"
msgstr "The Understanding rules backend still extracts only its existing 2D elasticity subset. Heat and Poisson drafts mainly come from the LLM. The Understanding Operator path still organizes only problem-side fields; later ``plan_method`` performs method selection."


msgid "``ready_for_validation=True`` 只表示方法草稿能通过 ``MethodSpec`` 与注册表检查，不表示 问题规格或问题—方法组合已经通过 Validation Agent。声称可生码、复制或下载前，调用方必须 对最终组合另外要求 ``validate_specs(problem, method_draft).ok``。修改任一规格后，旧通过 状态立即失效并必须重检。Planning 不生码、不训练，也不调用 Repair。"
msgstr "Planning readiness does not mean Validation accepted the pair. Before codegen or export, callers must require ``validate_specs(problem, method_draft).ok`` on the final pair. Editing either spec invalidates the prior result."

msgid "Specification Validation Agent（原 Agent A）是 Planning 后的最终问题—方法组合闸， 并且仍然只接受现有线弹性 ``ProblemSpec``。旧 ``validate`` 与 ``openpinn.agents.validator`` 导入保持兼容；新代码推荐 ``validate_specs`` 或 ``ValidationAgent.validate``。下游代码生成不得绕过它。Understanding 显示就绪，只说明可以 离开问题理解；它不表示线弹性校验已经通过，也不提供生成或下载。"
msgstr "The Specification Validation Agent, formerly Agent A, is the final gate after Planning. Legacy imports remain compatible; new code should use ``validate_specs`` or ``ValidationAgent.validate``. Understanding readiness does not provide code generation or export."

msgid "Validation 是确定性规格合规检查，不依赖 LLM。它检查当前实现真正支持的 schema、注册项、 边界、问题—方法兼容性与可选代码静态规则；不保证边值问题适定、训练收敛或物理结论正确。 当前二维弹性 codegen 只实现平面应力；``ProblemSpec`` 尚无平面应变选择器，因此平面应变会 诚实标为不支持。有限板固支加牵引算例也不把 Kirsch 无限板解当作精度门禁。"
msgstr "Validation is deterministic and checks only implemented schemas, registry entries, boundaries, compatibility, and optional static code rules. It does not guarantee well-posedness, convergence, or physical correctness. Current 2D elasticity codegen implements plane stress only, and the finite plate does not use Kirsch as an accuracy gate."
